235
00:14:15.813 --> 00:14:18.149
[father] What do you mean. "moving them"?
No one wants them.

236
00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:19.817
It's too much of a hassle. You drink 'em.

237
00:14:20.985 --> 00:14:22.362
Yes. Mizi Cafe.

238
00:14:25.573 --> 00:14:27.116
Uh. yes. Just a moment.

